91 _9b52f6c" style="width: 16px; height: 16px;"><div class="a510c7ce _0652043"></div></div><div class="_9ecc93a"></div><div class="ds-markdown"><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">The user is on browser but doesn't see "Personalization" option in settings. They're looking for the memory feature. Let me help them navigate based on current ChatGPT interface.</span></p><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">Recent ChatGPT interface changes: Personalization might be under different names now, or the settings might be organized differently. Common paths:</span></p><ul><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">Settings → Personalization (older)</span></p></li><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">Settings → Memory (newer direct)</span></p></li><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">Settings → Data controls → Memory</span></p></li><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">Under profile menu directly</span></p></li></ul><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">Also could depend on:</span></p><ul><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">Account type (free vs Plus)</span></p></li><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">Region (some features not available everywhere)</span></p></li><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">Browser version</span></p></li></ul><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">Let me give practical guidance without overcommitting.</span></p></div></div><div class="_8f7678d"></div></div><div class="ds-markdown ds-assistant-message-main-content"><h1><span class="">دعنا نجدها معًا</span></h1><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">واجهة ChatGPT تغيّرت في الفترة الأخيرة، وأسماء الخيارات تختلف حسب الحساب والمنطقة. سأساعدك بالخطوات المحتملة.</span></p><h2><span class="">جرّب هذه المسارات بالترتيب</span></h2><h3><span class="">1. اذهب مباشرة إلى "Settings"</span></h3><ul><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">اضغط على </span><strong><span class="">دائرة الأحرف/الصورة</span></strong><span class=""> أسفل يسار الشاشة.</span></p></li><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">اختر </span><strong><span class="">Settings</span></strong><span class="">.</span></p></li><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">في القائمة الجانبية للـSettings، ابحث عن:</span></p><ul><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong><span class="">Personalization</span></strong><span class=""> ← الاسم القديم</span></p></li><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong><span class="">Memory</span></strong><span class=""> ← الاسم الجديد (قد يظهر مباشرة)</span></p></li><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong><span class="">Data controls</span></strong><span class=""> ← قد تكون Memory داخلها</span></p></li><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><strong><span class="">Custom instructions</span></strong><span class=""> ← منفصل عن Memory</span></p></li></ul></li></ul><h3><span class="">2. جرّب الوصول من داخل محادثة</span></h3><ul><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">افتح أي محادثة.</span></p></li><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">اكتب في الأعلى أو في الإعدادات: ابحث عن أيقونة </span><strong><span class="">Settings</span></strong><span class="">.</span></p></li><li><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">بعض النسخ تضع </span><strong><span class="">Memory</span></strong><span class=""> داخل قائمة منبثقة من </span><strong><span class="">المحادثة نفسها</span></strong><span class="">.</span></p></li></ul><h3><span class="">3. جرّب هذا الرابط المباشر</span></h3><p class="ds-markdown-paragraph"><span class="">افتح في نفس المتصفح الذي تسجّل فيه الدخول:</span></p><div class="md-code-block md-code-block-dark"><div class="md-code-block-banner-wrap"><div class="md-code-block-banner md-code-block-banner-lite"><div class="_121d384"><div class="d2a24f03"><span class="d813de27">text</span></div><div class="d2a24f03 _246a029"><div class="efa13877"><div role="button" class="ds-button 